OL,3,GNEWSAFallen tree cut off water to
OL,4,Athousands of homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water pipe that left 8,500
OL,7,Fhomes and businesses without running
OL,8,Fwater was caused by a fallen tree, it
OL,9,Fhas been confirmed.
OL,11,FThe major outage affected residents in
OL,12,FStourbridge in the West Midlands on
OL,13,FWednesday, with about 8,500 homes and
OL,14,Fbusinesses left with no water at the
OL,15,Fpeak of the incident.
OL,17,F"We've identified the complex repair,
OL,18,Fit's a tree that came down and its
OL,19,Froots had damaged the pipework so we're
OL,20,Fworking on that," Howard Perry, Severn
OL,21,FTrent Water's head of water quality,
OL,22,Ftold BBC Radio WM.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
